    "body": "Consider the linear system \n\n\\[\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & 1 & a\\\\\n0 & 1 & a^2-2 \\\\\n3 & 2 & 2\n\\end{array}\\right]\\textrm{\\textbf{x}} = \n\\left[\\begin{array}{c} 1\\\\ a \\\\3  \\end{array} \\right]\n\\]\n(1) Find a row echelon form for the augmented matrix of the system. \n\n(2) For which value(s) of $a$ does this system have an infinite number of solutions? \n\n(3) For which value(s) of $a$ does this system have no solution? \n\n(4) For which value(s) of $a$ does this system have a unique solution? ",
